#. L_IMP_015
msgid "Automatic gun activated.\n"
msgstr "Automatic gun activated.\n"

#. L_IMP_016
msgid "Too many hostages killed.\n"
msgstr "Too many hostages killed.\n"

#. L_IMP_017
msgid "Hostages have been saved.\n"
msgstr "Hostages have been saved.\n"

#. L_IMP_018
msgid "Sensitive information has been destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Sensitive information has been destroyed.\n"

#. L_IMP_019
msgid "Carrington has been killed.\n"
msgstr "Carrington has been killed.\n"

#. L_IMP_020
msgid "Joanna - we're under attack.\n"
msgstr "Joanna - we're under attack.\n"

#. L_IMP_021
msgid "Get the guns back on line - hurry.\n"
msgstr "Get the guns back on line - hurry.\n"

#. L_IMP_022
msgid "The Skedar have taken hostages.\n"
msgstr "The Skedar have taken hostages.\n"

#. L_IMP_023
msgid "Get up to the offices and save them.\n"
msgstr "Get up to the offices and save them.\n"

#. L_IMP_024
msgid "They're using a new form of shield technology.\n"
msgstr "They're using a new form of shield technology.\n"

#. L_IMP_025
msgid ""
"Foster was working on a new weapon which may \n"
"be useful.\n"
msgstr ""
"Foster was working on a new weapon which may \n"
"be useful.\n"

#. L_IMP_026
msgid "Damn it. My office... If they get access...\n"
msgstr "Damn it. My office... If they get access...\n"

#. L_IMP_027
msgid "Get there first, Jo, and destroy the files.\n"
msgstr "Get there first, Jo, and destroy the files.\n"

#. L_IMP_028
msgid "Things are desperate. They've planted a bomb.\n"
msgstr "Things are desperate. They've planted a bomb.\n"

#. L_IMP_029
msgid "Find it and get it out of the building.\n"
msgstr "Find it and get it out of the building.\n"

#. L_IMP_030
msgid "Access denied - authorization failure.\n"
msgstr "Access denied - authorization failure.\n"

#. L_IMP_031
msgid "Emergency overrides have been engaged.\n"
msgstr "Emergency overrides have been engaged.\n"

#. L_IMP_032
msgid "Well done, Joanna. We're nearly clear...\n"
msgstr "Well done, Joanna. We're nearly clear...\n"

#. L_IMP_033
msgid "The last dropship is waiting for you. Hurry.\n"
msgstr "The last dropship is waiting for you. Hurry.\n"

#. L_IMP_034
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\n"

#. L_IMP_035
msgid "The autodefenses will really help me out.\n"
msgstr "The autodefenses will really help me out.\n"

#. L_IMP_036
msgid "So this is what Foster was working on.\n"
msgstr "So this is what Foster was working on.\n"

#. L_IMP_037
msgid ""
"I'll have to go carefully... The hostages are \n"
"counting on me.\n"
msgstr ""
"I'll have to go carefully... The hostages are \n"
"counting on me.\n"

#. L_IMP_038
msgid ""
"Well, at least I won't know if I'm doing \n"
"anything wrong.\n"
msgstr ""
"Well, at least I won't know if I'm doing \n"
"anything wrong.\n"

#. L_IMP_039
msgid "The bomb has been detonated...\n"
msgstr "The bomb has been detonated...\n"

#. L_IMP_040
msgid "You have been given a Devastator.\n"
msgstr "You have been given a Devastator.\n"

#. L_IMP_041
msgid ""
"All ready, Joanna? We can't keep the Maian delegation waiting. Or the "
"President, of course.\n"
msgstr ""
"All ready, Joanna? We can't keep the Maian delegation waiting. Or the "
"President, of course.\n"

#. L_IMP_042
msgid ""
"Am I ready? What do you mean? I was ready half an hour ago. It was you "
"holding us up!\n"
msgstr ""
"Am I ready? What do you mean? I was ready half an hour ago. It was you "
"holding us up!\n"

#. L_IMP_043
msgid ""
"But you know how it is, Joanna... I had to make sure my hair was just right,"
" and then there was the suit...\n"
msgstr ""
"But you know how it is, Joanna... I had to make sure my hair was just right,"
" and then there was the suit...\n"

#. L_IMP_044
msgid "They should keep you away from mirrors. Nervous?\n"
msgstr "They should keep you away from mirrors. Nervous?\n"

#. L_IMP_045
msgid ""
"Very. I've waited for this moment for so many years. Contact, friendly "
"contact, between Humans and Maians is what the Institute was founded for. "
"And in a few minutes we'll be at the White House, and it will finally "
"happen...\n"
msgstr ""
"Very. I've waited for this moment for so many years. Contact, friendly "
"contact, between Humans and Maians is what the Institute was founded for. "
"And in a few minutes we'll be at the White House, and it will finally "
"happen...\n"

#. L_IMP_046
msgid "Where did that come from?\n"
msgstr "Where did that come from?\n"

#. L_IMP_047
msgid "It was up on ground level...\n"
msgstr "It was up on ground level...\n"

#. L_IMP_048
msgid ""
"Looks like someone doesn't know when to quit. We've got to get everyone "
"out!\n"
msgstr ""
"Looks like someone doesn't know when to quit. We've got to get everyone "
"out!\n"

#. L_IMP_049
msgid "Get clear! I'll hold them off... You can come back and get me later!\n"
msgstr "Get clear! I'll hold them off... You can come back and get me later!\n"

#. L_IMP_050
msgid "At least, I hope you can.\n"
msgstr "At least, I hope you can.\n"

#. L_IMP_051
msgid "You need the Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "You need the Data Uplink.\n"

#. L_IMP_052
msgid "Connection has been made.\n"
msgstr "Connection has been made.\n"

#. L_IMP_053
msgid "Bypassing security systems.\n"
msgstr "Bypassing security systems.\n"

#. L_IMP_054
msgid "Virus has been downloaded successfully.\n"
msgstr "Virus has been downloaded successfully.\n"

#. L_IMP_055
msgid "Ship's engines have been activated.\n"
msgstr "Ship's engines have been activated.\n"

#. L_IMP_056
msgid "Connection to ship has been broken.\n"
msgstr "Connection to ship has been broken.\n"

#. L_IMP_057
msgid "Obtain Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Obtain Data Uplink.\n"

#. L_IMP_058
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_IMP_059
msgid "Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "Data Uplink\n"

#. L_IMP_060
msgid "A Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "A Data Uplink\n"

#. L_IMP_061
msgid "Picked up a Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Picked up a Data Uplink.\n"
